# The CLI entry point must keep LF line endings on every checkout: a shebang
# ending in CRLF breaks the installed command on Linux and macOS, and pnpm
# refuses to pack it (ERR_PNPM_BIN_CRLF), for example on a Windows runner with
# core.autocrlf=true. Other files follow the checkout's settings, so Windows CI
# keeps exercising CRLF Spec Kit files.
bin/** text eol=lf
